Reinitialize Vorbis decoders at new headers and keep chained packet times continuous.
A seek to zero on a newly opened Vorbis input uses the known data offset.
Decoder and Vorbis parser changes use LGPL-2.1-or-later. The oggdec.c and
oggdec.h changes use their existing MIT license. Original notices are retained.

